# Only the API code, its lockfile and the seed data are uploaded to Cloud Build. Never secrets or caches.
# Leading slashes anchor rules to the repo root (src/claims_api/api/ must not be excluded).
*
!/Dockerfile
!/api/
/api/*
!/api/pyproject.toml
!/api/uv.lock
!/api/src/
!/data/
/data/*
!/data/seed/
**/__pycache__/
